23:14:11 --- repl-help: HELP
23:14:11 Commands:
23:14:11   BEGINCFG ... ENDCFG        - add sensor config (multi-line)
23:14:11   BEGINCFG|k=v|...|ENDCFG    - add sensor config (inline with '|', supports \|)
23:14:11   BEGINRULE ... ENDRULE      - add rule (multi-line)
23:14:11   BEGINRULE|k=v|...|ENDRULE  - add rule (inline with '|', supports \|)
23:14:11   RUN / STOP                 - control sampling
23:14:11   TRIGGER <sensor|source>     - arm one-shot/event-driven sensor(s)
23:14:11   PAIR <A> <B> <A|B> <guard_us> - one stopped-mode sonar pair diagnostic (50 ms)
23:14:11   WINDOW <A> <B> <radar> <guard_us> <A_mm> <B_mm> <xmin> <xmax> <ymin> <ymax>
23:14:11   WINDOW STATUS [8-hex nonce] - read-only metrics after STOP (no reset)
23:14:11   CLEAR                      - clear sensors + rules
23:14:11   SHOW / SHOWRULES           - show sensors / rules
23:14:11   CLEARRULES                 - clear only rules
23:14:11   HELP                       - this text
23:14:11 
23:14:11 Example inline rule (HMC5883L big-endian X,Z,Y at 0x03):
23:14:11 BEGINRULE|name=GY511_MAG|source=GY511_ACC|calc=mx=s16be(0)|calc=mz=s16be(2)|calc=my=s16be(4)|calc=mag=sqrt(mx*mx+my*my+mz*mz)|when=mag>350|action=log:MAG change detected|ENDRULE
